@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
# @baseUrl = http://schedule-visits.test/api/v1

### Whole upcoming schedule -> 200, one entry per day; today starts at the next hour
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1/availability
Accept: application/json

### Single day -> 200, same shape with a single day
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1/availability?date=2026-09-10
Accept: application/json

### Day with bookings -> 200, the booked hours come back with "available": false
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1/availability?date=2026-09-05
Accept: application/json

### Past date -> 200 with an empty slot list, no query is issued
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1/availability?date=2020-01-01
Accept: application/json

### Date beyond the generated horizon -> 200 with an empty slot list
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1/availability?date=2030-01-01
Accept: application/json

### Malformed date -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1/availability?date=10-09-2026
Accept: application/json

### Date sent as an array -> 400, not a 500
# Request::query() returns null for non-scalar values, so this must not blow up.
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1/availability?date[]=2026-09-10
Accept: application/json

### Unknown vehicle -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/9999/availability
Accept: application/json
